Apple is working on AirPods that have cameras for feeding data to <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a>. The new earbuds will be Apple's first AI wearable, and they're expected to <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/19/airpods-with-cameras-2027-launch/">launch sometime in 2027</a>.<br/>
